      "type": "examAlert",
      "items": [
        "Surat Split occurred in 1907 at the INC session chaired by Rash Behari Ghosh.",
        "Lucknow Pact of 1916 reunited Moderates and Extremists and forged an alliance between INC and the Muslim League.",
        "Gandhi's first Satyagraha in India was the Champaran Satyagraha (1917) against the Indigo Tinkathia system.",
        "Annie Besant established her Home Rule League in September 1916 at Madras, while Tilak set up his in April 1916 at Belgaum."
